  <h2 id="test">Checkpoints and a first test</h2>

  <p>
    Use The 4-Checkpoint Protocol on your own situation, then run a short test before paying any fee.
  </p>

  <div class="protocol-stack">
    <div class="checkpoint">
      <div class="checkpoint__num">01</div>
      <div class="checkpoint__body">
        <div class="checkpoint__title">Biology: how you work</div>
        <p>Can you live with remote postings, rotating shifts and long stretches away from home? Do you prefer modelling at a desk or field work? Name your answer honestly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="checkpoint">
      <div class="checkpoint__num">02</div>
      <div class="checkpoint__body">
        <div class="checkpoint__title">Context: money and family</div>
        <p>What is the total education budget? Does the fee stay within roughly 10% to 20% of it? Is a loan needed? If yes, stop and compare cheaper routes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="checkpoint">
      <div class="checkpoint__num">03</div>
      <div class="checkpoint__body">
        <div class="checkpoint__title">Market: is it a bleeding-neck problem?</div>
        <p>Oil will be needed for years, and India is short of its own supply. But the number of entry jobs is small and cyclical, so check live postings and ask recruiters about the last two years, not the best year.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="checkpoint">
      <div class="checkpoint__num">04</div>
      <div class="checkpoint__body">
        <div class="checkpoint__title">Survival: is it AI-resistant?</div>
        <p>Partly. Routine interpretation and monitoring are under pressure, while judgment, safety and cross-checking are not. Your edge is domain knowledge plus data skill plus communication.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <p class="gates-block__title">Pass The 3 Gates before you pay a fee. Some people need a few weeks, others a couple of months.</p>
    <div class="gates-row">
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 1</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of skill</span>
        <p>Do one small project on public data: a decline-curve fit on a published well, or a simple volume estimate, with a one-page write-up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 2</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of communication</span>
        <p>Explain the project aloud in 30 seconds to two minutes, in plain English, to someone who does not know oil.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Gate 3</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Proof of value</span>
        <p>Show it to three working engineers and ask if it would help a student get shortlisted. Believe their answer over your hope.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

