  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Do not decide this in the abstract. Write down the total education budget, mark 10% and 20% of it, and check that against the real fee sheet. Then pick the cheapest route that still keeps GATE and ONGC possible, and start the Gate 1 project.
  </p>

